<style>
  @page {
    size: A4;
    margin: 0;
  }
  .page {
    width: 794px;
    height: 1123px;
    padding: 50px 60px;
    box-sizing: border-box;
    overflow: hidden;
    page-break-after: always;
    position: relative;
    font-family: "DejaVu Serif", "Liberation Serif", Georgia, "Times New Roman", serif;
  }
  .page:last-child {
    page-break-after: auto;
  }
  h1, h2, h3 {
    font-family: "DejaVu Sans", "Liberation Sans", Arial, sans-serif;
  }
  .form-group {
    margin-bottom: 15px;
  }
  .label {
    display: inline-block;
    width: 150px;
    font-weight: bold;
  }
  .input-field {
    border-bottom: 1px solid #000;
    display: inline-block;
    width: calc(100% - 160px);
  }
  .section-header {
    font-weight: bold;
    margin-top: 20px;
    margin-bottom: 10px;
  }
  .signature-line {
    margin-top: 50px;
    border-top: 1px solid #000;
    width: 300px;
  }
</style>

<div class="page">
  <div style="text-align: center; margin-bottom: 30px;">
    <h1 style="font-size: 36px; margin: 0;">New Paltz</h1>
    <p style="font-size: 14px; margin: 5px 0 0 0;">STATE UNIVERSITY OF NEW YORK</p>
  </div>

  <h2 style="text-align: center; font-size: 20px; margin-bottom: 30px;">SUNY New Paltz Foundation – Securities Transfer Request</h2>

  <div class="section-header">Section I.</div>
  <p>This is a request to <span data-field="request_type">{{ request_type }}</span></p>

  <div class="form-group" style="margin-top: 15px;">
    <input type="checkbox" style="margin-right: 10px;">
    I wish to donate shares of stock to the SUNY New Paltz Foundation (SNPF). Shares can be transferred directly from your brokerage account to SNPF's account. Please complete the form below in its entirety and send a copy or fax to your broker to initiate the transfer. A copy or fax of the form must be sent to the SUNY New Paltz Foundation Business Office at <span data-field="business_office_fax">{{ business_office_fax }}</span>. Please see our mailing address below.
  </div>

  <div class="form-group">
    <input type="checkbox" style="margin-right: 10px;">
    I wish to donate mutual funds or other types of financial instruments to the SUNY New Paltz Foundation. Please contact or ask your broker to contact the SUNY New Paltz Foundation Business Office at <span data-field="business_office_phone">{{ business_office_phone }}</span> for further information. Mutual Funds must be sold prior to delivery.
  </div>

  <div class="section-header">Section II.</div>
  <p>Personal Information</p>

  <div class="form-group">
    <span class="label">Name:</span>
    <span class="input-field" data-field="full_name">{{ full_name }}</span>
  </div>

  <div class="form-group">
    <span class="label">Home Address:</span>
    <div style="display: flex;">
      <span class="input-field" style="width: 70%;" data-field="home_address">{{ home_address }}</span>
      <span class="input-field" style="width: 20%;" data-field="home_address_2">{{ home_address_2 }}</span>
      <span class="input-field" style="width: 10%;" data-field="home_address_3">{{ home_address_3 }}</span>
    </div>
  </div>

  <div class="form-group">
    <span class="label">City:</span>
    <span class="input-field" style="width: 30%;" data-field="city">{{ city }}</span>
    <span class="label" style="width: 100px;">State:</span>
    <span class="input-field" style="width: 20%;" data-field="state">{{ state }}</span>
    <span class="label" style="width: 100px;">Zip Code:</span>
    <span class="input-field" style="width: 20%;" data-field="zip_code">{{ zip_code }}</span>
  </div>

  <div class="form-group">
    <span class="label">If New Paltz Alumnus:</span>
    <span class="input-field" style="width: 30%;" data-field="if_new_paltz_alumnus">{{ if_new_paltz_alumnus }}</span>
    <span class="label">Degree Year:</span>
    <span class="input-field" style="width: 20%;" data-field="degree_year">{{ degree_year }}</span>
    <span class="label">School:</span>
    <span class="input-field" style="width: 30%;" data-field="school">{{ school }}</span>
  </div>

  <div class="section-header">Section III.</div>
  <p>Gift Information PLEASE BE SURE TO CONTACT YOUR BROKER TO INITIATE THE TRANSFER</p>

  <div class="form-group">
    <span class="label">Your Broker's Name:</span>
    <span class="input-field" data-field="broker_name">{{ broker_name }}</span>
  </div>

  <div class="form-group">
    <span class="label">Broker's Telephone Number:</span>
    <span class="input-field" data-field="broker_phone">{{ broker_phone }}</span>
  </div>

  <div class="form-group">
    <span class="label">Number of Shares:</span>
    <span class="input-field" data-field="number_of_shares">{{ number_of_shares }}</span>
  </div>

  <div class="form-group">
    <span class="label">Security Name:</span>
    <span class="input-field" data-field="security_name">{{ security_name }}</span>
  </div>

  <div class="form-group">
    <span class="label">Ticker Symbol (if known):</span>
    <span class="input-field" data-field="ticker_symbol">{{ ticker_symbol }}</span>
  </div>

  <div class="form-group">
    <span class="label">Gift Designation:</span>
    <span class="input-field" data-field="gift_designation">{{ gift_designation }}</span>
  </div>

  <div class="form-group" style="margin-top: 20px;">
    <p>Please accept this security transfer request as your authorization to transfer from account <span data-field="account_number">{{ account_number }}</span> to the SUNY New Paltz Foundation's account as follows:</p>
    <div style="margin-top: 10px;">
      <span class="label">Firm:</span>
      <span class="input-field" data-field="firm_name">{{ firm_name }}</span>
    </div>
    <div style="margin-top: 10px;">
      <span class="label">DTC:</span>
      <span class="input-field" data-field="dtc_number">{{ dtc_number }}</span>
    </div>
    <div style="margin-top: 10px;">
      <span class="label">Customer Name:</span>
      <span class="input-field" data-field="customer_name">{{ customer_name }}</span>
    </div>
    <div style="margin-top: 10px;">
      <span class="label">Account Number:</span>
      <span class="input-field" data-field="account_number_transfer">{{ account_number_transfer }}</span>
    </div>
    <div style="margin-top: 10px;">
      <span class="label">New Paltz Contact:</span>
      <span class="input-field" data-field="new_paltz_contact">{{ new_paltz_contact }}</span>
    </div>
  </div>

  <div style="margin-top: 40px;">
    <p>Please be sure that New Paltz is notified of the details of your stock gift to ensure proper acknowledgement of your gift. Please fax a copy of this transfer request to us at <span data-field="fax_number">{{ fax_number }}</span> or a copy can be mailed to</p>
    <p style="margin-top: 10px;">
      <span data-field="mailing_address_line1">{{ mailing_address_line1 }}</span>. Thank you!
    </p>
  </div>

  <div class="signature-line">
    Signature(s) of account owner(s)
  </div>
</div>